/**
 * Get detail of single payment_method record by ID
 * (PaymentsDiscounts.payment_methods).
 *
 * Retrieves all data for a specific payment_method, including type, masked
 * details, provider, activation status, user assignment, and creation time.
 * Used for account settings UI, forensic/audit review, or financial dashboard
 * drilldown. Only visible to authorized users or administrators with proper
 * privileges. The operation is read-only, non-mutating, with compliance error
 * handling for not-found, unauthorized, or revoked methods.
 *
 * @param props.connection
