 * 2. Retrieve the archive using its valid ID, verify that all IEvidenceArchive metadata fields are present and accurate.
 * 3. Attempt to fetch an archive using an invalid/nonexistent UUID; confirm proper error is thrown/returned according to API contract.
 * 4. (Optional) Simulate unauthorized access if access control is enforced, and validate access denied behavior.
