 * provided metadata and evidence, and the new record is returned. Validation or
 * conflict errors (e.g., duplicate user/product/time) produce actionable
 * responses with evidence of failure. Related: POST/PUT/DELETE for
 * modifications, PATCH for listing/searching recommendations.
