 * evidence-grade fields. Implements comprehensive auditability, compliance, and
 * traceability protocols, supporting advanced filter/sort logic, and full
 * coverage of AI/ML, fraud, or business workflows. Must log all query actions
 * for compliance reporting. Response structure supports data pipeline
 * integration, bulk analytics, model operations, and extensibility for future
 * transaction event types.
