 * 4. (Simulated) Switch context to User B and attempt to fetch User A’s voucher; expect access denied (or equivalent) outcome.
 *
 * If the test infra supports full user auth simulation, role switching for steps 2/4 should be implemented; otherwise, this test highlights location for such logic.
 */
