 * 2. Deletion of the consent entry just created, verifying that the returned result
 *    confirms the consent ID matches and the deletion flag is properly set (logical/soft delete).
 * 3. Attempt to delete the same consent a second time; expect a not found or already deleted error.
 * 4. Attempt to delete a random, non-existent consent ID; expect a not found error response.
