 * 2. Validate output type and returned field values; ensure id is generated and matches business expectations.
 * 3. Iterate over each required field, create a request omitting that field, and confirm the endpoint rejects with an error.
 * 4. Attempt to submit an identical access log entry twice; if deduplication is required, expect an error, otherwise confirm two unique records are produced.
