/**
 * E2E test for deletion and restrictions of inventory records.
 *
 * Validates the following:
 * 1. Create an inventory record by POST /productCatalog/inventory.
 * 2. Delete the inventory record by DELETE /productCatalog/inventory/{id}.
 * 3. Confirm the deleted record is no longer accessible (attempting to delete again should error or be idempotent).
 * 4. Attempt to delete a non-existent inventory id and confirm correct error/response.
 * 5. (Simulated) Attempt delete when record is referenced by mandatory business relation – should be forbidden (skipped if no API for reference creation).
 */
