/**
 * Search and retrieve paginated list of catalog evidence records
 * (ProductCatalog.catalog_evidence) for compliance or investigation.
 *
 * Provides paginated, filtered results for catalog evidence records, leveraging
 * the catalog_evidence entity in the ProductCatalog domain. This operation
 * allows searching by reference uris, catalog event linkage, evidence
 * timestamp, and descriptions.
 *
 * Request body supports complex filters (event ID, string match on description,
 * creation window, etc.), sort parameters (by time, description, or event), and
 * standard pagination controls. Typical use cases include regulatory evidence
 * export, legal/forensic investigation, or admin audit of catalog
 * modifications. Security and permission checks enforced for evidence access.
 *
 * Each returned record is a normalized atomic evidence object, not including
 * bulk file blobs—only reference, description, and linkage metadata. Compliance
 * with GDPR/CCPA and preservation of audit-trail is mandatory. Query complexity
 * must be contained to protect API response time; index coverage of filterable
 * fields required.
 *
